  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Systemrevision IDLO Kenya 2017-20</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Systems Audit IDLO Kenya 2017-20</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment aims at assessing the internal management and Control systems of IDLO&#xb4;s HQ and country office in Kenya. The Consultant is expected to identify possible weaknesses. Based on the findings, the Embassy of Sweden will require that IDLO Kenya in dialogue with the Embassy of Sweden addresses the weaknesses as appropriate before or during the agreement phase.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget syftar till att uppskatta IDLOs huvudkontor samt landskontor i Kenyas interna management och kontrollsystem. Konsulten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter. Baserat p&#xe5; unders&#xf6;kningens resultat kommer Sveriges ambassad att beg&#xe4;ra att IDLO Kenya adresserar dessa svagheter i dialog med ambassaden, innan eller under avtalstiden.</narrative>
  </description>
